## Title: BetterBuffsForever
## Notes: A buff check on WoW Forever for druids and paladins: a box at the top centre lists who lacks your buff (Mark of the Wild and Thorns; blessings by class, no aura, Righteous Fury when tanking) and low reagents. Click a name to buff it. Hidden in combat. /bbuff
